  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "与君长别日，悲忆少年时……",
      "output_sha256": "8642a84f0ae249ba4861bfab974a5ebc6e1cab30145982a8bc5bb70d545f89ab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "8642a84f0ae249ba4861bfab974a5ebc6e1cab30145982a8bc5bb70d545f89ab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "听到罗莘田（常培）先生病故的消息，我就含着热泪写下前面的两句。",
      "output_sha256": "63ef117212ca4809608b5dd5878e7dbc347f9129efee2237561ad0b98d8eb727",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "63ef117212ca4809608b5dd5878e7dbc347f9129efee2237561ad0b98d8eb727",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我曾想为他写几首诗，寄托我的哀思，然而越是思念，泪水越是止不住，心思难以集中，最终无法继续下去。",
      "output_sha256": "03e21a42ccce1ffc7588c092c9465ddb7eaa2a91fd054dc41c16e74424173d5f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": 0.353795,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        3,
        4
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "230b2b5411fc441b5f75f2eb7ac60e221ba03797fef43e4595cfdbba8772500f",
        "d7017ff3810f1d0c8548f557971faee1009dc4e8de0ce19788002dc7ee715ae5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_ai_sha256": "03e21a42ccce1ffc7588c092c9465ddb7eaa2a91fd054dc41c16e74424173d5f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "悲忆少年时！",
      "output_sha256": "d53c00179256472241cda86a30da0d8acc12f8801114dd016e0f42ddd10787d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "d53c00179256472241cda86a30da0d8acc12f8801114dd016e0f42ddd10787d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "的确，莘田是我小学时的同班同学。",
      "output_sha256": "5240e55f7b218bbc4be520f8a33272a8e829f6aef49c58c35378a91b6f91caef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.567967,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "db54881e274b92e16b92c3a71cba14b98e5383f05ad206b73267a22ea4358874"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5240e55f7b218bbc4be520f8a33272a8e829f6aef49c58c35378a91b6f91caef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "自我们相识至今，整整五十年过去了！",
      "output_sha256": "a48cf8a50fb4de2e4b61bf635aa22b4af97f6f95b71be8b16d33bd3558dc5a45",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.528477,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1ddb8655d3ec7c86ff3537ad58aea38ebc26739031f0c721c04cf904ca476a4c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a48cf8a50fb4de2e4b61bf635aa22b4af97f6f95b71be8b16d33bd3558dc5a45",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "叫我怎能不哭呢？",
      "output_sha256": "e730430941513f3700f77cee56429507c008e22e1c1142a0b4899390aec4968c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "e730430941513f3700f77cee56429507c008e22e1c1142a0b4899390aec4968c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "在这五十年间，世事与国家发生了翻天覆地的变化，许多少年时期的朋友早已失联或不知所踪。",
      "output_sha256": "40db520e40a772863244dcf8cdcdc4ed48af4aec9bbeaa61ce7786dcfa629cb4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": 0.54481,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a194f158af5c29e4671afedbb577d2991c03a88dc63b94759659dde109b34f1a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_ai_sha256": "40db520e40a772863244dcf8cdcdc4ed48af4aec9bbeaa61ce7786dcfa629cb4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "每当莘田还在世时，我们提及此事，总觉得这五十年来的友情尤为珍贵。",
      "output_sha256": "77aceaf78103ea60fdb5ef9d718bc388331f97ce3c18919831fb2b1692a0c03c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.492199,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "062cc55a6288714db7fae87f3a7e231cc601003d4ab809825c99a577a7bbd984"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "77aceaf78103ea60fdb5ef9d718bc388331f97ce3c18919831fb2b1692a0c03c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我仍清晰地记得：我从私塾转学到小学堂，编入初小三年级，与莘田同班。",
      "output_sha256": "627c27e05b68bd96e17e849fa951eec6295605cae04d44bfe705348ed020b722",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.702616,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6dae195972597224212b50d6c3a032285db4643ac2d83df05a5a9375cfa84a15"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "627c27e05b68bd96e17e849fa951eec6295605cae04d44bfe705348ed020b722",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们的学校位于西直门大街南侧，是一所二等小学。",
      "output_sha256": "cb0a8c111a33444ad4d8e13bf7a6910da2d8dcafc882ca7bef6d73c2d957a195",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.628095,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        12
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "23fb380fda47a96e1d2ed6aba8cfd738ffa8b8720263bb93e9895b8eae5a7e1b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cb0a8c111a33444ad4d8e13bf7a6910da2d8dcafc882ca7bef6d73c2d957a195",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在同学中，他给我的印象最深，他品学兼优。",
      "output_sha256": "ab88c4c229a92adf4ac0d98c53b31b54b7ccf5aa2f43c4f002b8ec1b8e41a800",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab88c4c229a92adf4ac0d98c53b31b54b7ccf5aa2f43c4f002b8ec1b8e41a800",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "而且长长的发辫垂在肩前；别人的辫子都垂在背后。",
      "output_sha256": "730bd626ca557bd8dfbfc397421036abe42ff33fdb275986e0b8ca49185e8478",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "730bd626ca557bd8dfbfc397421036abe42ff33fdb275986e0b8ca49185e8478",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "虽然也吵过嘴，可是我们的感情始终很好。",
      "output_sha256": "75253fa7b655ca457d6c7adec587cc0e579758d31f573fbd5fc1ebe5b834d6ec",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "75253fa7b655ca457d6c7adec587cc0e579758d31f573fbd5fc1ebe5b834d6ec",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "下午放学后，我们每每一同到小茶馆去听评讲《小五义》或《施公案》。",
      "output_sha256": "f71af46f78f535d815f73fe995a69e6841baf36149dac54abc417f62b7cc58bc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "f71af46f78f535d815f73fe995a69e6841baf36149dac54abc417f62b7cc58bc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "书钱总是他替我付。",
      "output_sha256": "aeb4cd0a2bccbfd56ec3137bcbd91bd03c0084f56aa6259a5ccf951130d0212e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "aeb4cd0a2bccbfd56ec3137bcbd91bd03c0084f56aa6259a5ccf951130d0212e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我家里穷，我的手里没有零钱。",
      "output_sha256": "3a6efcdecbb9df38f42d962016630971c6a9aed5bd5cd835c892eee3585ac54d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "3a6efcdecbb9df38f42d962016630971c6a9aed5bd5cd835c892eee3585ac54d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不久，这个小学堂改办女学。",
      "output_sha256": "1464cee2696fd3814ccab358e613a63f6d3323d9fbbb432260a01a460ba4c578",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "1464cee2696fd3814ccab358e613a63f6d3323d9fbbb432260a01a460ba4c578",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我就转入南草厂的第十四小学，莘田转到报子胡同第四小学。",
      "output_sha256": "fdace9ca795a5b678d0c75a3fca2b80791d84c71fc00f485894e07dd787eb025",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "fdace9ca795a5b678d0c75a3fca2b80791d84c71fc00f485894e07dd787eb025",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "于是，我们的见面机会减少。",
      "output_sha256": "8b1049c17b36f003a8086fcbb0d66c6dfafc6c6722f926ee2e94cf932ae3c2ff",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": 0.39513,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bc9d5fe45de3ac303bb03df413784c67089b31d4686f33bb16c08d809a653984"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "8b1049c17b36f003a8086fcbb0d66c6dfafc6c6722f926ee2e94cf932ae3c2ff",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "到入中学的时候，我们俩都考入了祖家街的第三中学，他比我小一岁，而级次高一班。",
      "output_sha256": "ab785db6105408d8f9812c0324be4b7426181a51454f0b205b309710a61c6560",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "ab785db6105408d8f9812c0324be4b7426181a51454f0b205b309710a61c6560",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他常常跃级，因为他既聪明，又肯用功。",
      "output_sha256": "6d3b451c5708438280c0eaac9544eecdd411ddcf9bf5fb91d4a645c687a8eb50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d3b451c5708438280c0eaac9544eecdd411ddcf9bf5fb91d4a645c687a8eb50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他的每门功课都很好，不像我那样对喜爱的就多用点心，不喜爱的就不大注意。",
      "output_sha256": "65feeb9348487b7b38df07727898b64b88b193a90f3cff62e534893d00214623",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "65feeb9348487b7b38df07727898b64b88b193a90f3cff62e534893d00214623",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在“三中”没有好久，我即考入北京师范，为的是师范学校既免收学膳费，又供给制服与书籍。",
      "output_sha256": "26cf909774c28ad70b23d99698ad5a69d1dcc29220026f5e942209c7c9d069a8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "26cf909774c28ad70b23d99698ad5a69d1dcc29220026f5e942209c7c9d069a8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "从此，我与莘田的见面更加稀少。",
      "output_sha256": "7fa6f4363b9f36281bdb5fc9c9a4ade07e6f0e4ac1410d417aa45772ad036782",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.544966,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a04858b5859563d92ff5f48140aa98af74721f0fa5c2efa90dfbb50c738b07c7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7fa6f4363b9f36281bdb5fc9c9a4ade07e6f0e4ac1410d417aa45772ad036782",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "师范毕业后，我即去办小学，莘田一方面在参议院作速记员，一方面在北大读书。",
      "output_sha256": "3fe4b231cca8ad20668d79d1d993d7f9efedb4428283d09e12a4d7972ab2bddb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "3fe4b231cca8ad20668d79d1d993d7f9efedb4428283d09e12a4d7972ab2bddb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这就更难相见了。",
      "output_sha256": "423ebda205c06b37c918b30bddd3bcccd02f0de397e8780daa85c8cf0f3fd868",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "423ebda205c06b37c918b30bddd3bcccd02f0de397e8780daa85c8cf0f3fd868",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "虽然不常见面，但我们的心始终相连。",
      "output_sha256": "9ca1f46388f1f4991aac0306c59b02a2200551e122d94ed9f1f7ace53e41f2d9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.422216,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "9a6d664cfd641b89cbd6e523b83dfbda5dc78f453e0903caaa359ab276ebbab4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9ca1f46388f1f4991aac0306c59b02a2200551e122d94ed9f1f7ace53e41f2d9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "此后许多年月中都是如此，忽聚忽散，而始终彼此关切。",
      "output_sha256": "808e612129e0610ca04d1889ebe7e31c9f814ee3d9aec301ab9a067d855e4c89",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "808e612129e0610ca04d1889ebe7e31c9f814ee3d9aec301ab9a067d855e4c89",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "直到解放后，我们才又都回到北京，常常见面，高高兴兴地谈心道故。",
      "output_sha256": "60f00276c6c6eda3f8a007499000ce98d922e09445db6eaa9edb7df5f6974b6f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "60f00276c6c6eda3f8a007499000ce98d922e09445db6eaa9edb7df5f6974b6f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "莘田是位学者，而我并非。",
      "output_sha256": "5ffc8c64c1c15ba94a134782c120c2dc25b2798d20e536ee4d71885e180229a0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.554231,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7c52ab4c02ad1e8c66ef3beb7a981e5f63bd531d57bee7c894431f009ed78a2a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "5ffc8c64c1c15ba94a134782c120c2dc25b2798d20e536ee4d71885e180229a0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他的著作，我看不懂。",
      "output_sha256": "321ae59c27bae56c9bc9fa95259500a5a1ceefbb7d7e219d7737d50136886d6c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "321ae59c27bae56c9bc9fa95259500a5a1ceefbb7d7e219d7737d50136886d6c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那么，我们为何能如此谈得来，即使距离遥远，依然挂念彼此呢？",
      "output_sha256": "9af5adf1b97a22b4be157aba0251feff368443da26e0530d9a4ed07d741dc401",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.454755,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e1ac055fe3db439ec0a42bcce4a70ed4b2139312c656ea9fd3ad4bc63b3c3753"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9af5adf1b97a22b4be157aba0251feff368443da26e0530d9a4ed07d741dc401",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        30
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我想，首先是我们在为人处世上有许多共同点，我们都不屑于巴结他人，也不惧怕自己受些委屈。",
      "output_sha256": "f7f30dc9d83d29061f0b3cb9a8dbff26e273e3f237b86c1739463def79c252a7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.551561,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cc26ce56bc80394a8aa1687325bd4f1c6dfc690e43e20bf5d5514eb611816f52"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f7f30dc9d83d29061f0b3cb9a8dbff26e273e3f237b86c1739463def79c252a7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这样，在那污浊的旧社会里，就能够独立不倚，不至被恶势力拉去作走狗。",
      "output_sha256": "b6b4e0b5a49745f8ecf03b502d89c33db2d5788aeb08f2201a85b52610a2f3c5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "b6b4e0b5a49745f8ecf03b502d89c33db2d5788aeb08f2201a85b52610a2f3c5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们愿意自食其力，哪怕清苦一些。",
      "output_sha256": "5def48a6248c47ea891c1edbe9c5572f2fc251e5352e628b7ad46203738fdf5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "5def48a6248c47ea891c1edbe9c5572f2fc251e5352e628b7ad46203738fdf5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "记得在抗日战争中，我在北碚，莘田由昆明来访，我就去卖了一身旧衣裳，好请他吃一顿小饭馆儿。",
      "output_sha256": "2e18625d68a3a216e2852d3dc3af2bdf6ce2b636a8398dac6037d8142bc1f34f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "2e18625d68a3a216e2852d3dc3af2bdf6ce2b636a8398dac6037d8142bc1f34f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是，他正闹肠胃病，吃不下去。",
      "output_sha256": "1cbe3e5cae2547e00fc134f8fc4da1e3effa22e83200c909e9b16a9e02f0960d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "1cbe3e5cae2547e00fc134f8fc4da1e3effa22e83200c909e9b16a9e02f0960d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是，相视苦笑者久之。",
      "output_sha256": "66beb45df58688023ff2ce2745d87602c381d9c6093c3694d75d09f96fad47c8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "66beb45df58688023ff2ce2745d87602c381d9c6093c3694d75d09f96fad47c8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "是的，遇到一处，我们总是以独立不倚，作事负责相勉。",
      "output_sha256": "1b3f5a725f5b47d09476a770afb817f04849c4c589a79a9cfcdd9f3ab04ad724",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "1b3f5a725f5b47d09476a770afb817f04849c4c589a79a9cfcdd9f3ab04ad724",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "志同道合，所以我们老说得来。",
      "output_sha256": "32ca45256e99d8815533b9052e074153ae398bdd3dd4ef4e26176e9173fa1ed8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "32ca45256e99d8815533b9052e074153ae398bdd3dd4ef4e26176e9173fa1ed8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "莘田对责任感极为看重，他的学生们对此深有体会。",
      "output_sha256": "d351e74bf0fac4d14bd817ea807df131ab7f3c2a1415c671745a0104aa53a6e1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": 0.543529,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e15cc11e2c9c11864fc8f575441cde08f6912ed94e84b2fde069579a65783c89"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d351e74bf0fac4d14bd817ea807df131ab7f3c2a1415c671745a0104aa53a6e1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "学生们大概有点怕他，因为他对他们的要求，在治学上与为人上，都很严格。",
      "output_sha256": "adb071c01b9defc2476e99fe039393fa462d91225b0e8646134de4c2a69647f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "adb071c01b9defc2476e99fe039393fa462d91225b0e8646134de4c2a69647f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "学生们也都敬爱他，因为他对自己的要求也严格。",
      "output_sha256": "678376aae7aa53b4fe95c6999ca2ccb3cb3bde903e00da9a7b82ce54e110ebf4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_human_sha256": "678376aae7aa53b4fe95c6999ca2ccb3cb3bde903e00da9a7b82ce54e110ebf4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他不仅要求自己教好学生，还希望他们能够独当一面，独立思考。",
      "output_sha256": "1298d20a75c93b880c95adcd96139c5097e10e152435f649398be67621a2f22e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.575616,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        46
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a6f359720bf8e71f314bb84f71b998651aa3c61879d431975ab43e63f807f86f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1298d20a75c93b880c95adcd96139c5097e10e152435f649398be67621a2f22e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他是那么负责，哪怕是一封普通的信，一张字条，也要写得字正文清，一丝不苟。",
      "output_sha256": "17efe852ea7e5fbf182f0390a6db4a08df68ce8c62d69dc42193521565f9f444",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "17efe852ea7e5fbf182f0390a6db4a08df68ce8c62d69dc42193521565f9f444",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "多少年来，我总愿向他学习，养成凡事有条有理的好习惯，可总没能学到家。",
      "output_sha256": "678526b7eccc18051a1017b596b46f4be7078dce50e77880bd1f961004009bea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "678526b7eccc18051a1017b596b46f4be7078dce50e77880bd1f961004009bea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "莘田所强调的独立精神，在旧社会中有其优势，使我们不至于被利欲所迷惑，能够保持清白。",
      "output_sha256": "e300d0b6adb6a9f558e97bcc52dfee8db9c41cc462b780184a6640f21bf5e367",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.539699,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        49,
        50
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e9d02804224143cba939325c6e577afd2c4374b931b543dfef8501543c2413c6",
        "23a0e26c399ee12eff331c661eee3beaeeab1581d13eba8357e82254b2b3a864"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e300d0b6adb6a9f558e97bcc52dfee8db9c41cc462b780184a6640f21bf5e367",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是它也有毛病，即孤高自赏，轻视政治。",
      "output_sha256": "90180bb0e1268feb2529f71f23178245591a72a3206249af8bbc3dad2af04305",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_human_sha256": "90180bb0e1268feb2529f71f23178245591a72a3206249af8bbc3dad2af04305",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "莘田的这个缺点也正是我的缺点。",
      "output_sha256": "0ef3ba27aa2adfe101bc4712823a3f84641ad285de25f419ef63c4ed0126817b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "0ef3ba27aa2adfe101bc4712823a3f84641ad285de25f419ef63c4ed0126817b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们因不关心政治，便只知恨恶反动势力，而看不明白革命运动。",
      "output_sha256": "6c1d528ae3974a48bf5a95e9990354ba295ffd41ce361cd206750a36c9e50d2a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "6c1d528ae3974a48bf5a95e9990354ba295ffd41ce361cd206750a36c9e50d2a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们武断地认为，既然都是政治，就都无法清白。",
      "output_sha256": "dd6994df5a00dfb0faaf6069c9120957d099345db41be2a58f747e4ddff90319",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": 0.620836,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a4f7e1936e801c643a9ae320ec5a2c2d9fdc04509768e490df310a54c539e2d7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dd6994df5a00dfb0faaf6069c9120957d099345db41be2a58f747e4ddff90319",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "在革命时代里，我们犯了错误——只有些爱国心，而不认识革命道路。",
      "output_sha256": "435842d9a798318f4ee4e29a486fb04275abad88cdf23f3f2e45d8b41a9f6d9d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "435842d9a798318f4ee4e29a486fb04275abad88cdf23f3f2e45d8b41a9f6d9d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "细想起来，我们的独立不倚不过是独善其身，但求无过而已。",
      "output_sha256": "683e3835bb21771d9a263b377c7aa8e54a14589684342a5ab11304dd07ede4bd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "683e3835bb21771d9a263b377c7aa8e54a14589684342a5ab11304dd07ede4bd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我们的四面不靠，来自黑白不完全分明。",
      "output_sha256": "3bb89a3b94af0658d570981e571a210f6dc9b53656d5df4a1360225f4f5d1b70",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 57,
      "source_human_sha256": "3bb89a3b94af0658d570981e571a210f6dc9b53656d5df4a1360225f4f5d1b70",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我们试图远离黑暗势力，却又无从逃避，最终不敢靠近革命。",
      "output_sha256": "ab546cca1e8683b37c24a90e723304619db8567ac0ea681d21c973879897aa92",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": 0.522596,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        58
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1834529831a40ae8adbdbf2682227078bea5f87f5d2eaecd0d0fa9527cedbcf2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ab546cca1e8683b37c24a90e723304619db8567ac0ea681d21c973879897aa92",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "直到革命成功，我们才明白救了我们的是革命，而不是我们自己的独立不倚！",
      "output_sha256": "e0703fae6ab5960bae69ab5b44b40f7d04e3f19dc5eaf9ed98f465aec59a26f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "e0703fae6ab5960bae69ab5b44b40f7d04e3f19dc5eaf9ed98f465aec59a26f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "是的，解放后，我们才明白了自己的错误，愿意追随共产党，积极服务人民。",
      "output_sha256": "d6e21812e2b71bdaea97cf94f8586b16639526332e6577a6f3ad6a8b5ec216a5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": 0.620112,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        60
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "e4ad2bd12a3510e6e6e80c744909023ddfc6d8438c836b625677a491c4f1859d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d6e21812e2b71bdaea97cf94f8586b16639526332e6577a6f3ad6a8b5ec216a5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        52
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 59,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "彼此见面，我们不再提独立不倚，而代之以关心政治，改造思想。",
      "output_sha256": "824988f4545f5ff16ced334cba7759665e56a256a501d368b7723f9ed299b908",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 61,
      "source_human_sha256": "824988f4545f5ff16ced334cba7759665e56a256a501d368b7723f9ed299b908",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 60,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "然而，长期养成的思维习惯常常成为我们思想进步的障碍。",
      "output_sha256": "3479656ff53b83ec05cffb3b5b78206e1ecb99a2374b43011757f3d5ff887da0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.478618,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        62
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a1c2a0055a3463e40aa6f759932618fb090e3438e1b7479d12aad3c7968cf1ac"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3479656ff53b83ec05cffb3b5b78206e1ecb99a2374b43011757f3d5ff887da0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        54
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 61,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "莘田哪，假若你能多活几岁，我相信我们会互相督励，勤于学习，叫我们的心眼更亮堂一些，胸襟更开朗一些，忘掉个人的小小顾虑，而全心全意地接受党的领导，作出更多更好的工作来！",
      "output_sha256": "bbbbc1cf3ef0aec7e508d5fb74d9c9129486915ec20c104056ac2565804e85f5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 63,
      "source_human_sha256": "bbbbc1cf3ef0aec7e508d5fb74d9c9129486915ec20c104056ac2565804e85f5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 62,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "你离开得太早了！",
      "output_sha256": "9e3e0693ee916ae300a7e43f7e1ee3319c884eca8b1215e0e4c0b7150b78e425",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": 0.540018,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        64
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
