    {
      "sentence_index": 68,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我知道：这二三年来，你的最大苦痛就是因为身体不好，不能照常工作，老觉得对不起党与人民！",
      "output_sha256": "59bb327aa24c0b9569785a146715edd48231837ef9c81b9ca95ab94f7a14aecc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 63,
      "alignment_score": null,
