      "alignment_unit_index": 65,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 72,
      "source_human_sha256": "0fe6e04374cf77553eb645aad43fc06e83f06a3f6ddcca3ea986d66e94b27012",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 71,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "疾病夺走了你的生命，但你的朋友、学生与子女将因你给予的关爱与教育而感激党，紧紧依靠党，全心全意为社会主义建设而努力！",
      "output_sha256": "2a0f16c1d1f42b18f823fc69b04ff5d20f6ecd15e30e4ec700d66cf43e2bc8d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 66,
      "alignment_score": 0.637076,
